Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=32}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 50,0:02:16.07,0:02:19.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NBut it seems to me\Nwe're not even moving.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:19.57,0:02:20.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You feel that?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:20.74,0:02:23.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI screams]
Dialogue: 50,0:02:34.34,0:02:37.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No! We're screwed!\NWe've entered the Calm Belt!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:37.89,0:02:38.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NThe Clam Belt?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:38.89,0:02:39.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NWhat's that?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:39.72,0:02:40.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NCalm Belt!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:40.54,0:02:42.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A part of the sea where\Nnothing moves a muscle!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:42.23,0:02:43.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NSo there's mussels and clams?!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:43.31,0:02:44.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NNo!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:51.40,0:02:52.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What was that? An earthquake?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:52.61,0:02:54.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A good trick since we're at sea.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:54.40,0:02:56.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All of this chitchat isn't\Ngoing to get us outta here.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:56.82,0:02:58.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Fold the sails and\Nstart paddling now!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:58.74,0:03:00.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We have to get back on course!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:00.33,0:03:01.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NYou can count on me.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:02.04,0:03:03.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't panic.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:03.79,0:03:05.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And besides, this is a sailboat.\NWhy do we need to paddle?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:05.54,0:03:06.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NTrue.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:06.75,0:03:07.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And why would we go through\Nthe trouble of doubling back
Dialogue: 50,0:03:07.79,0:03:09.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,when the Marines\Nare waiting for us?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:09.59,0:03:12.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Look, there's no time to argue.\NJust shut up and do as I say!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:12.71,0:03:14.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,At least it's nice\Nand quiet here.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:14.62,0:03:15.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NUgh!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:15.40,0:03:17.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Fine! If I need to explain\Nit to you, I will!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:17.93,0:03:19.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,In our haste to escape\Nfrom the Marines,
Dialogue: 50,0:03:19.58,0:03:20.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,we ended up going too far south
Dialogue: 50,0:03:20.98,0:03:22.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and now we're off course\Nand stuck out here.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:22.80,0:03:24.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NSouth? So we\Nentered the Grand Line?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:24.98,0:03:26.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NWoohoo!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:26.50,0:03:27.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If we were at the Grand Line,
Dialogue: 50,0:03:27.50,0:03:29.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,you think I'd waste my\Ntime explaining this?!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:31.44,0:03:32.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now look!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:32.44,0:03:34.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The Grand Line is\Nsandwiched in the middle
Dialogue: 50,0:03:34.90,0:03:37.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,between these two green areas\Nyou see here, ya understand?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:37.41,0:03:40.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,These areas, just\Nas they're labeled,
Dialogue: 50,0:03:40.29,0:03:41.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,are what's called\Nthe Calm Belts.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:41.83,0:03:43.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's where we are!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:43.85,0:03:46.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nobody knows why,\Nbut inside the Calm Belt,
Dialogue: 50,0:03:46.09,0:03:47.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,there's no wind and no current.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:47.58,0:03:49.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's like a void where\Neverything's stagnate.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:49.63,0:03:52.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Given that sailboats move\Nby catching winds,
Dialogue: 50,0:03:52.88,0:03:54.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,this is more than a dangerous\Nregion, it can be fatal!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:54.13,0:03:55.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Get it?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:55.63,0:03:57.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NNope, but it sounds\Nlike we're in big trouble.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:57.72,0:04:00.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NGood. You retained more\Nthan I thought you would.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:00.18,0:04:02.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NSo this is what\Nthat geezer meant
Dialogue: 50,0:04:02.93,0:04:04.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,when he said it was dangerous.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:04.80,0:04:06.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NWell that explains\Nwhy we haven't gotten
Dialogue: 50,0:04:06.17,0:04:07.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,a single gust of wind.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:07.50,0:04:08.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NHow're we gonna get outta this
Dialogue: 50,0:04:08.84,0:04:10.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,if our ship can't move?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:10.10,0:04:12.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NMaybe the wind'll\Nstart blowing again.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:12.11,0:04:14.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NWind never blows\Nin the Calm Belt!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:14.34,0:04:15.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And that's not all.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:15.54,0:04:16.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's another good reason
Dialogue: 50,0:04:16.64,0:04:18.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,that people call this\Narea dangerous.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:18.61,0:04:20.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's infested with...
Dialogue: 50,0:04:20.73,0:04:21.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:28.87,0:04:31.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NSea Monsters! They're gigantic!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:36.92,0:04:39.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The Calm Belt is also\Nhome to the Sea Kings.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:39.59,0:04:41.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's their main place\Nfor breeding.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:41.93,0:04:42.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They're the biggest reason
Dialogue: 50,0:04:42.90,0:04:46.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,people can't cross\Nthe Calm Belt.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:49.35,0:04:50.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We don't wanna give\Nthem any reason
Dialogue: 50,0:04:50.83,0:04:51.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to stick around or eat us.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:51.48,0:04:54.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Once they're gone,\Nwe'll paddle back. Got it?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:54.86,0:04:56.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You call that a plan?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.61,0:04:57.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx80\fscy80\bord3.04\shad3.04}[NAMI]\NShut up!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:59.24,0:05:01.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NSorry.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:05.49,0:05:07.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That didn't improve anything!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:07.16,0:05:08.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It sounds like it's gonna...
Dialogue: 50,0:05:08.42,0:05:09.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NBrace yourselves!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:09.32,0:05:11.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I think this behemoth's\Ngonna sneeze!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:27.56,0:05:30.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, well, at least we're\Nback on our original course.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:30.35,0:05:31.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,According to the map,
Dialogue: 50,0:05:31.80,0:05:33.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,we should be spotting\Nthe Red Line any time now.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:37.90,0:05:40.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wow! We're almost there!\NThe Grand Line, at last!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:41.78,0:05:42.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hehehe. Isn't this exciting?!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:42.75,0:05:46.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're finally going!\NWe did it! We did it!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:46.03,0:05:47.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NCut it out!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:47.62,0:05:48.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:49.60,0:05:50.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NZoro! Can you believe it?!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:50.87,0:05:52.47,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI thinking]\NCan this be right?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:52.56,0:05:54.93,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Is the path to the Grand Line\Nreally as perilous
Dialogue: 50,0:05:54.96,0:05:56.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,as it's drawn here?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:56.29,0:05:57.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NStop that!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:57.76,0:05:59.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[hums]
Dialogue: 50,0:05:59.82,0:06:01.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:03.05,0:06:04.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NTake a look!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:05.39,0:06:06.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NI'm familiar with the rumors,
Dialogue: 50,0:06:06.95,0:06:09.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and these drawings confirm it!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:09.06,0:06:11.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,As unimaginable as it may seem,
Dialogue: 50,0:06:11.06,0:06:13.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the entrance to the\NGrand Line is a mountain!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:13.10,0:06:14.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NA mountain?!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:14.65,0:06:16.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NSo what, do we crash into it?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:16.02,0:06:17.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NYou gotta be kidding...
Dialogue: 50,0:06:17.15,0:06:19.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NI didn't believe it,\Nbut the map's clear...
Dialogue: 50,0:06:19.86,0:06:22.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The mountain appears to\Nbe riddled with small canals,
Dialogue: 50,0:06:22.15,0:06:24.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,so we might have\Nto go up and over it.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:25.41,0:06:27.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NOoo! Sounds like fun!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:27.20,0:06:28.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NWhat are you talking about...?!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:28.66,0:06:30.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Even if there are\Ncanals or whatever,
Dialogue: 50,0:06:30.88,0:06:33.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,a ship can't\Nclimb up a mountain!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:33.04,0:06:34.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, the map says otherwise!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:34.67,0:06:36.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:36.05,0:06:37.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And if Nami thinks something\Ncan be done, then it can!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:37.69,0:06:38.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Got that?!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:38.75,0:06:39.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but remember\Nthat map was stolen
Dialogue: 50,0:06:39.85,0:06:42.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,from Buggy the Clown...\NSo can we trust it?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:42.80,0:06:46.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NIn case no one's\Nnoticed, the rudder's stuck!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:46.14,0:06:48.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NSanji! Will you\Nplease give Usopp a hand?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:48.51,0:06:50.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can't think with\Nall his shouting!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:50.85,0:06:52.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NRight away, Nami!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:52.39,0:06:53.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:53.94,0:06:57.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh, does this current seem\Nunusually strong to anyone else?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:57.40,0:06:59.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NHmm? Usopp! What did\Nyou just say?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:59.77,0:07:01.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I asked if any of you noticed
Dialogue: 50,0:07:01.28,0:07:02.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the insane strength\Nof this current!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:02.53,0:07:05.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The current... That must be...
Dialogue: 50,0:07:05.15,0:07:06.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:06.28,0:07:08.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The canals do go\Nup the mountain!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:08.12,0:07:10.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NOh, come on... How could\Nthat possibly work?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:10.66,0:07:11.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Look right here!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:11.37,0:07:13.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ya see...? The guiding\Nlight was directing us
Dialogue: 50,0:07:13.88,0:07:15.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,toward this spot\Non the Red Line...
Dialogue: 50,0:07:15.71,0:07:18.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Notice how it's labeled\Nhere... Reverse Mountain!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:18.04,0:07:20.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hello...! Little help\Nover here, thank you!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:21.33,0:07:23.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NThese green lines\Nrepresent canals,
Dialogue: 50,0:07:23.46,0:07:25.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,or artificial waterways...
Dialogue: 50,0:07:25.10,0:07:27.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If major currents\Nfrom all four oceans
Dialogue: 50,0:07:27.16,0:07:28.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,flow toward this mountain,
Dialogue: 50,0:07:28.40,0:07:30.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,what do you\Nthink's gonna happen?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:30.23,0:07:32.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The currents would force\Nwater up these canals,
Dialogue: 50,0:07:32.80,0:07:34.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,collide at the top,
Dialogue: 50,0:07:34.23,0:07:36.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and then flow straight\Ndown into the Grand Line!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:36.85,0:07:38.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now, Reverse Mountain\Nis a "winter mountain,"
Dialogue: 50,0:07:38.43,0:07:39.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,so it's cold, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:39.02,0:07:42.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That means any surface currents\Nthat don't flow up the canal
Dialogue: 50,0:07:42.47,0:07:44.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,will be forced\Ndown as they cool.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:44.19,0:07:47.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Anything riding those currents\Nwould be pulled down as well.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:47.48,0:07:50.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If we screw up and miss\Nthe entrance to the canal,
Dialogue: 50,0:07:50.15,0:07:51.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the Going Merry\Nwill be carried straight
Dialogue: 50,0:07:51.42,0:07:53.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,into the Red Line's rock face
Dialogue: 50,0:07:53.46,0:07:55.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and likely be destroyed.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:55.60,0:07:56.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ship and crew would be sucked
Dialogue: 50,0:07:56.90,0:07:58.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to the bottom of\Nthe sea. Understand?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:58.25,0:07:59.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NYeah...
Dialogue: 50,0:07:59.67,0:08:02.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Basically... it's a mystery\Nmountain! Ha. Ha. Ha.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:04.09,0:08:07.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[sighs]\NNo, that's\Nnot my point at all.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:07.63,0:08:09.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Anyways, since we're\Npositioned on this current,
Dialogue: 50,0:08:09.36,0:08:10.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,we shouldn't run\Ninto any problems
Dialogue: 50,0:08:10.92,0:08:12.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,getting to the summit\Nof Reverse Mountain!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:13.02,0:08:14.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Only thing that\Nwould hurt us now
Dialogue: 50,0:08:14.26,0:08:15.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,is if something went\Nwrong with the rudder.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:15.93,0:08:18.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami, you're a genius...
Dialogue: 50,0:08:18.06,0:08:20.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Call me a skeptic, but ships\Ndo not climb mountains.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:20.98,0:08:22.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, I've heard\Na few stories...
Dialogue: 50,0:08:23.07,0:08:24.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stories about the\N"mystery mountain"?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:24.82,0:08:25.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NNo...
Dialogue: 50,0:08:25.69,0:08:28.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What I have heard is that\Nmore than half of the people
Dialogue: 50,0:08:28.60,0:08:30.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,who try to make it\Nto the Grand Line die
Dialogue: 50,0:08:30.16,0:08:30.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,before they even get there.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:31.78,0:08:34.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whatever we find,\Nit isn't going to be easy...
Dialogue: 50,0:08:35.12,0:08:36.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NSanji! Could you get the sail?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:36.62,0:08:38.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NAnything for you, Nami!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:38.37,0:08:39.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NLuffy! Help me!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:42.99,0:08:44.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:51.97,0:08:55.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey...! I can see the\N"mystery mountain"!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:55.35,0:09:00.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Aaah! That's insanely huge!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:02.40,0:09:04.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Haha! Oh, wow! Awesome!\NIt's bigger than I thought!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:05.48,0:09:07.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NI can't see the top!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:07.80,0:09:11.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's taller than the clouds!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:31.93,0:09:33.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're getting sucked in!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:34.35,0:09:35.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hold the rudder steady!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:35.97,0:09:37.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[SANJI, USOPP]\N– We're on it!\N– We're on it!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:44.77,0:09:47.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NWhere's that entrance\Nyou were talking about?!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:47.36,0:09:50.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If we keep this heading, we're\Ngonna crash into the rocks!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:52.66,0:09:54.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NThere's a crack in that cliff...
Dialogue: 50,0:09:54.39,0:09:56.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That must be it.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:57.45,0:10:00.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami...! Give us a direction!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:00.29,0:10:01.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Keep bearing straight ahead!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:01.71,0:10:02.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You can't be serious!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:02.87,0:10:04.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Trust me!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:04.73,0:10:05.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Have we made it?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:05.85,0:10:07.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is that the canal entrance?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:07.04,0:10:08.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,More than likely!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:09.17,0:10:10.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've gotta be dreaming!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:11.47,0:10:13.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's impossible...
Dialogue: 50,0:10:13.84,0:10:17.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The ocean really is\Nflowing up the mountain!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:20.22,0:10:20.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NWe have to make our way
Dialogue: 50,0:10:20.87,0:10:23.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,through those water\Ngates just right.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:23.81,0:10:26.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Or we'll crash into the Red Line\Nand be smashed to pieces...
Dialogue: 50,0:10:30.15,0:10:31.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're drifting off course!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:31.74,0:10:33.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gotta go more\Nto the right! Right!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:33.36,0:10:35.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The right?! Move it starboard!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:38.45,0:10:40.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NCome on, now!\NPut your back into it!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:47.88,0:10:49.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[NAMI, ZORO, LUFFY]\N– The rudder!\N– The rudder!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:49.42,0:10:52.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[LUFFY]\NGum-Gum Balloon!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:00.76,0:11:02.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NLuffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:02.31,0:11:03.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Grab ahold!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:12.03,0:11:15.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Yeah! Yay!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:16.07,0:11:18.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[SANJI, USOPP]\N– We made it!\N– We made it!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:24.87,0:11:28.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now it's just a straight\Nshot to the summit!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:42.47,0:11:43.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NWhoa! Look how high we are!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:45.64,0:11:48.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're in the clouds!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:59.37,0:12:01.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NThis is insane!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:03.12,0:12:05.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're not in the clouds,\Nwe're above them!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:15.55,0:12:16.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's amazing... We've done it!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:18.08,0:12:18.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We've reached the summit!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:31.40,0:12:33.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wh-hoo!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:33.71,0:12:35.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hahahaha!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:54.75,0:12:55.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NI can see it!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:56.21,0:12:58.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is the greatest sea\Nin the whole world!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:58.63,0:12:59.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The Grand Line!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:02.64,0:13:04.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Somewhere out there\Nthe One Piece is waiting,
Dialogue: 50,0:13:04.61,0:13:06.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and we're gonna find it!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:07.56,0:13:10.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NLet's go!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:24.62,0:13:26.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Did you guys just\Nhear something?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:26.49,0:13:28.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NIt was probably just the wind!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:28.41,0:13:31.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,At this speed everything\Nsounds distorted!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:32.01,0:13:36.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[loud groaning]
Dialogue: 50,0:13:36.25,0:13:37.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:37.80,0:13:40.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NNami! I see a mountain up ahead!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:40.30,0:13:42.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What? That's impossible...
Dialogue: 50,0:13:42.63,0:13:44.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NBut it's right\Nthere! I can see it!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:44.68,0:13:46.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Who cares...?! Go!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:47.64,0:13:49.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NAfter we pass\Nthe Twin Capes up ahead,
Dialogue: 50,0:13:49.42,0:13:51.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,there should be\Nnothing but ocean!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:52.05,0:13:53.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:57.25,0:14:02.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CREW]\NAaaaah!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:02.49,0:14:03.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NIt's a black wall!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:03.74,0:14:04.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NNo, it's not!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:04.91,0:14:06.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NThen, what is it?!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:07.28,0:14:08.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NIt's a whale!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:09.38,0:14:12.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[roars]
Dialogue: 50,0:14:12.37,0:14:14.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NWhat are we gonna do?!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:14.19,0:14:14.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NShould we fight?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:15.02,0:14:16.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NIdiot! How are\Nwe supposed
Dialogue: 50,0:14:16.26,0:14:17.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to fight a 100-ton whale?!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:17.18,0:14:18.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NB-B-B-B-But, we\Nh-h-have to do something!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:19.51,0:14:21.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Our path is blocked!\NHow do we escape?!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:21.22,0:14:22.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Calm down!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:23.22,0:14:25.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If this creature looks\Nlike a giant wall to us,
Dialogue: 50,0:14:25.19,0:14:27.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,we must be a spec!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:27.24,0:14:28.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's right...!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:28.17,0:14:29.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's highly possible\Nthat this thing
Dialogue: 50,0:14:29.50,0:14:31.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,isn't even aware\Nthat we're here!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:31.31,0:14:33.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NWe'll run right into\Nit unless we change course!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:33.85,0:14:35.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Look... We can\Nget by on the left!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:35.90,0:14:38.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Port...! Hard to port!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:38.94,0:14:40.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The rudder's broken!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:40.44,0:14:42.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NDo something! Anything!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:42.90,0:14:44.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait...! I know!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:44.28,0:14:46.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This'll work! It has to!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:46.57,0:14:47.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:47.24,0:14:49.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy, what're you doing?!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:54.46,0:14:56.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NThis is pointless!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:56.29,0:14:58.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The ship's not gonna turn!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:58.88,0:15:00.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NDammit!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:00.17,0:15:02.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NDon't give up!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:10.97,0:15:12.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NIs this the end?!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:19.90,0:15:22.11,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[USOPP, ZORO, NAMI, SANJI]\N– The cannon?!\N– The cannon?!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:22.11,0:15:24.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NDone...
Dialogue: 50,0:15:24.96,0:15:28.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Someone's coming out.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:32.08,0:15:33.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're screwed...
Dialogue: 50,0:15:33.58,0:15:34.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is it...
Dialogue: 50,0:15:35.14,0:15:36.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Auuuugh!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:37.42,0:15:39.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, that was my special seat!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:56.24,0:15:57.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Damn!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:57.30,0:15:58.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let's get out of here\Nbefore it's too late!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:58.90,0:16:00.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NSomeone mind telling\Nme what the heck is going on?!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:00.90,0:16:02.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NIt's so big\Nthat the cannon ball
Dialogue: 50,0:16:02.58,0:16:03.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,didn't even make it flinch
Dialogue: 50,0:16:03.48,0:16:04.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That or his reaction\Ntime's really slow!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:04.74,0:16:06.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NWho cares?!\NAt least we're alive!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:06.92,0:16:12.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[roars]
Dialogue: 50,0:16:12.53,0:16:13.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NAaaah! My ears...
Dialogue: 50,0:16:13.58,0:16:15.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NPaddle! Just paddle!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:15.20,0:16:17.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NWe have to get away from here...
Dialogue: 50,0:16:21.54,0:16:23.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:16:23.44,0:16:24.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NLuffy?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:24.46,0:16:25.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NYou think you\Ncan break my special seat
Dialogue: 50,0:16:25.87,0:16:27.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and get away with it?!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:28.33,0:16:30.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NTake this!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:31.72,0:16:34.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[CREW]\N– You moron!\N– You moron!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:41.65,0:16:42.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NI'm not through with you!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:43.03,0:16:44.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's a lot more\Nwhere that came...
Dialogue: 50,0:16:44.60,0:16:46.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Shut up before you kill us!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:50.07,0:16:51.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NPlease! No!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:56.60,0:16:59.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[screams]
Dialogue: 50,0:16:59.07,0:17:00.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Aaaah!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:07.38,0:17:08.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NLuffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:08.34,0:17:09.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NLuffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:15.43,0:17:18.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NI'm not gonna die!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:21.12,0:17:26.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Auugh!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:43.50,0:17:44.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ah, man...
Dialogue: 50,0:17:44.84,0:17:46.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Everyone's been swallowed whole!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:47.42,0:17:49.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Rrrg! Hey, you!\NCan you hear me?!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:49.79,0:17:50.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Spit 'em out!\NI want my friends...
Dialogue: 50,0:17:52.30,0:17:53.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:55.47,0:17:57.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NWhere do ya think\Nyou're going, ya jerk?!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:57.64,0:18:02.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You give them back\Nright now you whale!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:02.32,0:18:03.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Listen, ya big boat!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:03.32,0:18:05.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna ask again!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:05.61,0:18:08.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stop sinking...! I mean it!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:08.48,0:18:10.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My friends and me are\Non an important adventure...!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:10.78,0:18:12.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can't lose 'em!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:12.61,0:18:15.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Give them back!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:36.99,0:18:38.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NSo... What do you think?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:38.68,0:18:40.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NI don't know what to think...
Dialogue: 50,0:18:40.50,0:18:41.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NIs this even real?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:41.89,0:18:42.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP jibbers]
Dialogue: 50,0:18:42.82,0:18:45.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NBecause I know exactly\Nwhat I saw and what I felt.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:46.19,0:18:48.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We were swallowed by the whale.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:50.15,0:18:51.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NIs this a dream?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:51.82,0:18:54.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NYeah, I'd say that's a\Nfair guess.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:00.08,0:19:01.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Then what's with this island?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:01.61,0:19:02.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And the house?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:02.62,0:19:04.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Illusions.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:08.59,0:19:10.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NUmm... That's look likes...
Dialogue: 50,0:19:11.42,0:19:14.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[NAMI, USOPP]\N– A Great King Squid!\N– A Great King Squid!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:35.99,0:19:37.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Looks like someone's home.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:37.99,0:19:39.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let's hope it's a person.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:40.58,0:19:42.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've had it...! Let's go!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:42.58,0:19:44.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Giant squids,\Nguys with harpoons,
Dialogue: 50,0:19:44.56,0:19:46.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and where's Luffy?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:46.37,0:19:48.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, where is he?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:48.69,0:19:50.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uhh...
Dialogue: 50,0:19:50.46,0:19:52.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wha? I don't know\Nmuch about whales,
Dialogue: 50,0:19:52.18,0:19:55.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but since when do they have\Ndoors and lighted hallways?!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:58.42,0:19:59.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CROCUS]\NA ship...?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:59.52,0:20:02.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wh-Wh-Wh-Wh-Wh-Whoa!\NWe should fire our cannon there!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:03.44,0:20:04.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:04.00,0:20:04.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 50,0:20:04.64,0:20:05.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hold on a sec.
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=33}===============================DIALOGUE============================
